          "jcr:created": "Tue Feb 25 2020 19:35:05 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\">Your patient<br>\n </span><br>\n</span></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Allows them to feel part of their own treatment plan, and provides them with unique insight into their condition, progress and recovery</li>\n<li>Allows you to provide additional context around the procedure to your patients by summarizing outcomes of the same/similar procedures at your practice*<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
